  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MNG_Advancing Human Rights, Gender Equality, and Anti-Corruption in Law Enforcement in Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional fragility, democratic backsliding, shrinking civic space, and a crisis of trust and accountability are fuelling, and are compounded by, conflict, climate shocks and impacts, inequality, and digital disruption, undermining the foundations of peace and sustainable development.Implemented by the Governance, Rule of Law and Peacebuilding (GRP) Hub, the proposed initiative aims to tackle these challenges combining policy reform, institutional strengthening at national, local, and community levels, and the empowerment of rights holders, civil society, and local communities. By consolidating and integrating efforts across governance, rule of law and peacebuilding, the initiative reflects both the GRP Hub&#x2019;s mandate and country-level realities.</narrative>
  </description>
